       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. MAINPGM.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       77 R PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.
       77 K5 PIC 9(4) VALUE 5.
       77 K7 PIC 9(4) VALUE 7.
       77 S PIC X(10) VALUE "hello".
       77 T PIC S9(5)V99 VALUE 1.5.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           CALL "ADDER" USING BY REFERENCE R BY CONTENT K5.
           DISPLAY "R=" R.
           CALL "ADDER" USING R K7.
           DISPLAY "R=" R.
           CALL "UPPER" USING S.
           DISPLAY S.
           CALL "DBL" USING T RETURNING R.
           DISPLAY "T=" T " R=" R.
           CALL "NESTED" USING R.
           DISPLAY "R=" R.
           CALL "MISSING" ON EXCEPTION DISPLAY "NO SUCH PGM"
               NOT ON EXCEPTION DISPLAY "found" END-CALL.
           STOP RUN.

       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. ADDER.
       DATA DIVISION.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       77 X PIC 9(4).
       77 Y PIC 9(4).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING X Y.
           ADD Y TO X.
           GOBACK.
       END PROGRAM ADDER.

       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. UPPER.
       DATA DIVISION.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       77 S PIC X(10).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING S.
           MOVE FUNCTION UPPER-CASE(S) TO S.
           EXIT PROGRAM.
       END PROGRAM UPPER.

       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. DBL.
       DATA DIVISION.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       77 V PIC S9(5)V99.
       77 RES PIC 9(4).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING V RETURNING RES.
           COMPUTE V = V * 2.
           MOVE V TO RES.
           GOBACK.
       END PROGRAM DBL.

       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. NESTED.
       DATA DIVISION.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       77 Q PIC 9(4).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING Q.
           CALL "INNER" USING Q.
           GOBACK.
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. INNER.
       DATA DIVISION.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       77 Q PIC 9(4).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING Q.
           MULTIPLY 10 BY Q.
           GOBACK.
       END PROGRAM INNER.
       END PROGRAM NESTED.
